  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Origins_Plus_Plus/BH_NU_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Origins_Plus_Plus/BH_NU_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>Origins++ 是一個包含超過100種獨特起源的擴展包，旨在全面豐富起源遊戲體驗。每個起源都附帶優勢、劣勢和特殊能力，將徹底改變你的遊戲方式。</p><h3>參與我們</h3><ul>\n<li>遇到錯誤或有反饋建議？請提交至 <a href=\"https://github.com/QuantumXenon/origins-plus-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins++ GitHub</a> 頁面。</li>\n<li>有興趣翻譯模組？歡迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252forigins-plus-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins++ Crowdin</a> 頁面貢獻譯文。</li>\n</ul><h3>模組兼容性 (v2.2+)</h3><ul>\n<li>Origins++ 已內建對部分模組的兼容性支援。</li>\n<li>您還可以使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/QuantumXenon/origins-plus-plus-modded-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此數據包模板</a> 擴展其他模組的兼容性，進一步定制遊戲體驗。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://github.com/QuantumXenon/origins-plus-plus/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Origins_Plus_Plus/BH_NU_BANNER4.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/QuantumXenon/origins-plus-plus/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins++ 維基</a> 包含所有起源及其能力的完整列表供您探索。</p><p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/QuantumXenon/d7ec9ceee0f8897410cff5088307f028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Origins_Plus_Plus/BH_NU_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>所有原始起源的著作權歸屬其 <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/QuantumXenon/d7ec9ceee0f8897410cff5088307f028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原作者</a> 所有。特別感謝這些作者授權將他們的起源收錄至 Origins++。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fquantumxenon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Origins_Plus_Plus/BH_NU_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
